# T4 · 자연 정렬 끔(`list.sort_natural=off` = 새 탭 기본값): 글자 순 = file1 · file10 · file2.
id: natural-sort-off
title: 자연 정렬 끔 — 글자 순
tree: file file1.txt 1
tree: file file2.txt 1
tree: file file10.txt 1
settings: ui.lang=en
settings: list.sort_natural=off
cmd: @ready:list.dump:<out>/off.txt
cmd: @ready:quit
check: off.txt: 1 d0 None file10.txt
check: off.txt: 2 d0 None file2.txt
